WEBVTT

00:15.910 --> 00:22.330
White feathers gleam and fly away brightly

00:22.750 --> 00:29.380
kokoro dake nosete hoshii no ni

00:22.750 --> 00:29.380
Though I only want to set my heart on them

00:30.380 --> 00:36.640
tsumetai te wo nobasu todokanai... shitteru

00:30.380 --> 00:36.640
I extend my cold hands - They won't reach... I know

00:37.260 --> 00:44.350
dakedo ima furetai kimi ni

00:37.260 --> 00:44.350
But I want to touch you now

00:44.520 --> 00:50.480
natsukashii kaze ni ha ano koro no fune

00:44.520 --> 00:50.480
On that nostalgic wind - A ship from the past

00:50.900 --> 00:58.910
maboroshi ga omoide wo miseta

00:50.900 --> 00:58.910
An illusion showed me memories

00:59.950 --> 01:08.920
"wasurenai" dareka no koe ga setsunaku hibiku

00:59.950 --> 01:08.920
"I won't forget" Someone's voice echoes painfully

01:09.090 --> 01:14.010
hajimaru yokan ni furuete

01:09.090 --> 01:14.010
Trembling with a foreboding

01:14.300 --> 01:22.350
"wasuretai" negau jibun ga wakaranai

01:14.300 --> 01:22.350
"I want to forget" I cannot understand myself for hoping so

01:22.720 --> 01:32.070
matteiru yurarenagara yume hitotsu wo

01:22.720 --> 01:32.070
I shall wait while swaying, for that one dream

01:38.460 --> 01:43.040
Sky

01:58.380 --> 01:59.550
Matsuri!

02:03.680 --> 02:04.520
Yorito?

02:04.930 --> 02:06.480
That's enough, Sis.

02:06.480 --> 02:07.270
Step aside!

02:07.270 --> 02:07.850
No!

02:09.190 --> 02:10.100
Yorito...

02:17.650 --> 02:18.360
Sis!

02:22.200 --> 02:23.200
Sis...

02:24.910 --> 02:26.950
Matsuri, are you all right?

02:27.710 --> 02:28.790
I'm sorry.

02:29.210 --> 02:30.370
I hesitated.

02:31.210 --> 02:32.500
Let's head back first.

02:32.880 --> 02:33.590
We can't.

02:34.590 --> 02:36.090
We're running out of time.

02:37.840 --> 02:38.760
Matsuri...

02:39.180 --> 02:40.130
Hurry.

02:40.760 --> 02:42.680
You have to go... to Aono.

02:42.680 --> 02:45.720
You have to go... to Aono.

02:53.480 --> 02:54.900
How strange.

02:55.320 --> 02:57.400
My wound won't heal.

02:58.030 --> 02:59.360
Could it be... that the Yaka powers are...

02:59.360 --> 03:01.410
Could it be... that the Yaka powers are...

03:03.030 --> 03:06.040
I didn't think you would carry me.

03:06.040 --> 03:07.120
You don't like it?

03:07.660 --> 03:08.910
No... it's not that.

03:08.910 --> 03:10.460
No... it's not that.

03:10.750 --> 03:12.630
I just didn't think this would happen.

03:16.000 --> 03:20.300
When we first met, the sky was like this, too.

03:20.720 --> 03:21.720
Yeah.

03:23.180 --> 03:24.470
A cirrocumulus.

03:25.140 --> 03:26.680
Oh, you can tell.

03:26.930 --> 03:29.350
That's because you taught me.

03:30.890 --> 03:32.230
Nimbostratus clouds, cumulonimbus clouds, cirrus clouds, stratus clouds, cumulus clouds...

03:36.480 --> 03:37.150
And there's also-

03:37.150 --> 03:37.980
I'm sorry.

03:38.940 --> 03:43.030
In the end, I couldn't show you the real sky.

03:44.910 --> 03:47.740
No, you've shown it to me many times.

03:48.790 --> 03:50.410
The sky that you saw,

03:50.660 --> 03:53.040
the sky that you chased...

03:53.620 --> 03:55.380
I saw them all through your eyes.

04:02.930 --> 04:03.680
Yorito!

04:05.720 --> 04:08.140
Her Yaka powers... are getting weaker.

04:08.140 --> 04:09.560
Her Yaka powers... are getting weaker.

04:18.320 --> 04:19.280
Matsuri.

04:21.530 --> 04:22.240
Yorito,

04:23.320 --> 04:24.910
stay here.

04:25.870 --> 04:28.080
I'll be fine on my own from now on.

04:28.620 --> 04:29.450
But...!

04:31.160 --> 04:35.500
I don't want you to see us fighting.

04:36.790 --> 04:37.710
Matsuri...

04:37.710 --> 04:39.300
Don't worry.

04:39.880 --> 04:41.010
We'll meet again.

04:41.260 --> 04:42.590
I'm sure we will.

04:53.730 --> 04:54.980
What an obvious lie.

04:55.440 --> 04:56.310
Geez...

05:11.620 --> 05:13.410
Aren't you... hungry?

05:13.410 --> 05:14.580
Aren't you... hungry?

05:20.210 --> 05:22.210
Why are you here?

05:22.880 --> 05:25.010
I have nowhere else to go.

05:25.800 --> 05:30.010
And to tell the truth, I have to sacrifice my life to you.

05:30.430 --> 05:31.350
Why?

05:31.680 --> 05:33.600
Because there's a curse on the village.

05:33.930 --> 05:34.890
Why?

05:36.440 --> 05:37.560
Who knows...

05:37.940 --> 05:39.560
I don't know why.

05:39.900 --> 05:43.780
Since you wouldn't do such a thing.

05:44.320 --> 05:45.320
Why?

05:45.570 --> 05:47.660
I can tell that after coming here.

05:47.910 --> 05:50.320
You are not the kind of person who'd bring misfortune to others.

05:50.660 --> 05:52.990
You're here by yourself.

06:00.330 --> 06:01.090
How is it?

06:01.380 --> 06:02.460
It's delicious.

06:02.460 --> 06:03.420
Isn't it?

06:05.720 --> 06:08.050
You usually smile when you eat something delicious.

06:08.470 --> 06:09.340
Smile?

06:09.590 --> 06:10.220
Right.

06:13.060 --> 06:14.100
Like this.

06:24.440 --> 06:27.240
I remembered about you.

06:27.610 --> 06:28.490
So did I.

06:31.410 --> 06:32.950
Thank you for everything.

06:34.160 --> 06:36.950
You taught me all about feelings.

06:37.330 --> 06:38.620
Human feelings.

06:38.870 --> 06:43.380
Therefore, it's painful, sorrowful and hard, or am I wrong?

06:43.590 --> 06:46.760
But it's much better than not knowing them at all.

06:46.760 --> 06:48.090
Don't talk nonsense!

06:48.090 --> 06:49.050
You're wrong.

06:50.680 --> 06:52.390
That's what I really think.

06:53.430 --> 06:56.220
That's why I'll return you to normal.

06:56.890 --> 06:59.940
So you can then finally accept Yorito's death.

07:00.600 --> 07:02.980
This won't go the way you want.

07:19.830 --> 07:20.750
Sis,

07:21.250 --> 07:22.080
Matsuri,

07:22.540 --> 07:25.130
the sky will be visible soon.

07:43.850 --> 07:44.650
Matsuri!

08:03.040 --> 08:04.750
This will end it.

08:06.710 --> 08:07.960
Matsuri!

08:14.930 --> 08:16.680
Yorito...

08:16.930 --> 08:18.760
Sis...

08:21.600 --> 08:22.770
It can't be...

08:22.770 --> 08:23.520
Why?!

08:24.440 --> 08:25.150
Yorito...

08:25.730 --> 08:26.480
No...

08:26.900 --> 08:27.820
No!

08:28.610 --> 08:29.480
Sis.

08:30.280 --> 08:31.320
Yorito.

08:32.650 --> 08:33.700
Thank you...

08:37.450 --> 08:38.160
No.

08:38.490 --> 08:39.240
No.

08:39.410 --> 08:40.040
No...

08:40.240 --> 08:40.950
No...

08:41.450 --> 08:42.120
No!

08:42.200 --> 08:42.830
No!

08:42.910 --> 08:43.660
No!

08:43.660 --> 08:45.830
No!

08:46.210 --> 08:47.290
Yorito.

08:47.330 --> 08:48.090
Yorito...

08:48.210 --> 08:49.340
Yorito!

08:50.460 --> 08:52.130
Yorito... I won't hesitate any more.

08:52.130 --> 08:53.970
Yorito... I won't hesitate any more.

08:54.470 --> 08:58.140
Everything... will return... to normal.

09:04.480 --> 09:05.230
Yorito.

09:05.640 --> 09:06.900
Yorito...

09:09.610 --> 09:10.570
Aono,

09:15.280 --> 09:16.740
I give you... my life.

09:16.740 --> 09:18.120
I give you... my life.

09:29.380 --> 09:30.420
Matsuri...

09:31.000 --> 09:31.840
Look.

09:37.760 --> 09:39.260
Yorito...

09:50.150 --> 09:52.320
If I'm allowed,

09:52.690 --> 09:56.900
can I make a final wish?

09:57.700 --> 10:01.490
I want to look upon the sky we three gazed at back then.

10:01.910 --> 10:06.040
The distant, promised land I couldn't reach.

10:08.790 --> 10:10.080
This way.

10:10.080 --> 10:10.920
Why?

10:10.920 --> 10:12.590
Just come over here.

10:12.590 --> 10:13.250
Okay.

10:13.630 --> 10:14.670
Lay down here.

10:24.810 --> 10:25.850
This is...

10:26.430 --> 10:29.560
It's supposed to be the sky.

10:29.900 --> 10:32.190
I guess it was a little hard to pull off.

10:32.360 --> 10:33.230
The sky.

10:34.190 --> 10:36.150
Is this... the sky?

10:36.150 --> 10:37.440
Is this... the sky?

10:38.070 --> 10:38.780
Yes.

10:39.400 --> 10:42.240
You'll see it someday.

11:32.580 --> 11:33.290
Who are-?

11:34.540 --> 11:36.500
A ghost!

11:36.750 --> 11:38.000
How rude.

11:50.060 --> 11:51.480
What happened?

11:51.770 --> 11:53.140
Nothing.

11:53.140 --> 11:54.190
That boy was crying.

11:54.650 --> 11:58.480
He just took a peek and ran off.

12:02.190 --> 12:03.610
Wh-What?

12:03.900 --> 12:06.410
I've always wanted to tell you this...

12:12.790 --> 12:16.040
Your fashion sense is gradually worsening year by year.

12:16.670 --> 12:18.380
You jerk!

12:19.800 --> 12:21.800
I thought you'd outgrow it.

12:21.800 --> 12:22.920
Shut up.

12:29.010 --> 12:30.310
Say, Takeshi,

12:31.680 --> 12:34.140
why didn't you run away?

12:34.440 --> 12:35.770
What are you talking about?

12:37.100 --> 12:38.360
Nothing.

12:38.650 --> 12:39.690
Never mind.

12:41.980 --> 12:43.940
There's no way I'd run away.

12:46.870 --> 12:47.700
Takeshi...

12:49.740 --> 12:51.200
Now... let's go out before the rain stops.

12:51.200 --> 12:52.910
Now... let's go out before the rain stops.

12:56.710 --> 12:58.130
Takeshi, wait!

13:51.100 --> 13:52.510
Are you folding origami again?

13:52.760 --> 13:54.600
You sure don't get tired of it.

13:54.600 --> 13:58.020
Yes, I've really been captivated by it.

13:58.770 --> 14:00.440
Just one more fold here...

14:00.810 --> 14:02.480
and it's done.

14:07.320 --> 14:08.280
Coming.

14:10.120 --> 14:11.200
Hello, Koyori-chan.

14:11.200 --> 14:12.160
Hello.

14:13.160 --> 14:15.450
I humbly thank you both.

14:15.450 --> 14:17.250
You're always taking care of Mana-sa-

14:17.540 --> 14:19.080
That's Onee-chan, right?

14:20.210 --> 14:21.460
I'm sorry...

14:21.460 --> 14:22.790
What are you doing?

14:22.790 --> 14:24.760
Poor Koyori-chan.

14:24.800 --> 14:26.260
Yeah, really.

14:26.260 --> 14:27.970
She's so cute and you're...

14:28.550 --> 14:31.090
I apologize on behalf of your barbaric sister.

14:31.090 --> 14:33.760
"You're a second-year student now,

14:33.760 --> 14:35.850
so try acting a little calmer,"

14:35.850 --> 14:37.810
is what I've been telling you over and over again, but...

14:38.560 --> 14:39.520
It's okay.

14:39.770 --> 14:41.020
Hey,

14:41.230 --> 14:44.020
why am I being criticizied here?

14:46.490 --> 14:49.990
May I take your order?

14:50.240 --> 14:55.450
Today's specialties are the octopus and the pasta with basil pesto sauce.

14:55.910 --> 14:58.620
That really doesn't sound like a recommendation, though.

14:58.620 --> 15:00.710
If I order that, I'll probably get a stomachache.

15:00.960 --> 15:03.750
Anyway, how about cheering up a little?

15:03.750 --> 15:05.380
It's been a year already.

15:11.130 --> 15:12.720
Not again...

15:12.840 --> 15:17.470
But there's no better man other than the bearded dandy!

15:17.470 --> 15:23.560
After toying with my emotions, how could he just disappear without saying goodbye?

15:23.560 --> 15:24.690
That's too cruel!

15:25.190 --> 15:26.230
I've had enough of this.

15:26.530 --> 15:28.440
Mana, please take our orders.

15:28.650 --> 15:29.860
Yeah, yeah.

15:30.240 --> 15:33.280
By the way, why don't you work here as a waitress again?

15:33.620 --> 15:35.370
She obviously can't handle it alone.

15:35.410 --> 15:36.990
Why did you stop working here anyway?

15:38.250 --> 15:39.200
I wonder why.

15:39.660 --> 15:41.250
What's with that answer?

15:41.250 --> 15:43.380
I don't know why, either.

15:43.630 --> 15:46.500
I just wanted to change...

15:46.920 --> 15:48.000
something.

15:48.840 --> 15:50.010
Bearded...

16:08.320 --> 16:13.610
At this moment, I'd prefer being taller rather than being rich.

16:21.750 --> 16:23.580
Thank you very much!

16:24.460 --> 16:26.040
You're welcome.

16:37.100 --> 16:38.180
All done.

16:41.930 --> 16:42.930
Um...

16:43.100 --> 16:47.860
Can you please hold the front of this ship and close your eyes?

16:48.230 --> 16:49.150
Like this?

16:52.860 --> 16:53.610
There.

16:53.860 --> 16:56.030
Please, open your eyes.

17:00.620 --> 17:03.160
Oh, did know you about this?

17:03.500 --> 17:05.460
When I showed it to Mana-sa-

17:12.010 --> 17:14.090
Can you teach me a little more?

17:14.090 --> 17:14.800
Of course.

17:45.160 --> 17:46.290
Thank you.

17:47.000 --> 17:48.250
I really enjoyed it.

17:48.250 --> 17:52.750
I, too, thank you for accompanying me.

17:53.510 --> 17:54.710
See you later.

17:55.420 --> 17:56.260
Um...

17:58.550 --> 18:01.600
Could you please tell me your name?

18:02.470 --> 18:03.720
Aono.

18:04.680 --> 18:06.390
Morimiya Aono.

18:07.980 --> 18:10.020
Aono-san?

18:33.250 --> 18:35.630
So there was math homework after all.

18:36.260 --> 18:37.880
Let's see...

18:39.720 --> 18:40.840
Is this the one?

19:11.420 --> 19:12.580
Um...

19:17.630 --> 19:18.550
You are...?

19:18.550 --> 19:19.920
It flutters.

19:20.470 --> 19:23.140
This skirt is too short.

19:25.140 --> 19:27.270
Are you by any chance a transfer student?

19:27.270 --> 19:28.270
Yes.

19:28.560 --> 19:29.680
I see.

19:31.560 --> 19:33.060
Were you looking at the sky?

19:33.520 --> 19:35.270
Yes, I was.

19:35.730 --> 19:38.110
The sky is pretty when you see it from here, isn't it?

19:39.610 --> 19:42.200
The sunset is especially gorgous.

19:42.200 --> 19:45.240
I always come here after school to watch it.

19:45.950 --> 19:46.910
Why?

19:47.580 --> 19:49.000
I wonder why.

19:49.750 --> 19:51.660
Probably... because in the past...

19:54.330 --> 19:57.550
I don't know, but I think I like the sky.

19:58.420 --> 20:01.340
I think I really love the sky.

20:04.840 --> 20:07.930
I love the sky, too.

20:09.060 --> 20:13.060
Because this vast sky is connected to everything.

20:13.520 --> 20:14.770
To people... to oceans... to cities...

20:14.770 --> 20:16.190
To people... to oceans... to cities...

20:16.190 --> 20:18.070
To people... to oceans... to cities...

20:18.070 --> 20:20.530
and to the night.

20:20.530 --> 20:21.610
The night?

20:21.990 --> 20:22.780
Yes.

20:23.320 --> 20:25.370
The night sky lies on the other side.

20:25.780 --> 20:29.450
It's a sky that's connected just like this one.

20:30.910 --> 20:32.250
I guess you're right.

20:32.460 --> 20:34.170
That's why... I walk under the sky.

20:34.170 --> 20:36.750
That's why... I walk under the sky.

20:36.790 --> 20:40.130
Under the sky that those two granted me.

20:47.800 --> 20:48.930
Hey!

20:49.390 --> 20:50.180
Sky!

20:50.430 --> 20:51.430
I love you!

20:51.600 --> 20:55.850
I really love you!

21:05.070 --> 21:05.860
Let's go!

21:14.190 --> 21:18.100
nanigenai kotoba sae

21:14.190 --> 21:18.100
Even words uttered casually are

21:18.100 --> 21:21.960
kizamareta mune ga atsui

21:18.100 --> 21:21.960
Engraved into my heart – it’s burning.

21:22.550 --> 21:24.090
I'm sleepy.

21:23.520 --> 21:31.340
atarimae no you ni sugoshita hibi ga tooi yo

21:23.520 --> 21:31.340
The days we’ve spent together taking everything for granted are now distant.

21:29.970 --> 21:31.180
Onee-chan,

21:31.470 --> 21:33.730
if you don't wake up, the sunrise-

21:31.620 --> 21:35.690
kakegae no nai hito ga

21:31.620 --> 21:35.690
Illuminated by happiness is

21:35.890 --> 21:39.360
Geez, wake up already, Mana-sa-

21:36.200 --> 21:41.700
shiawase ni teraserete

21:36.200 --> 21:41.700
A person who can never be replaced

21:41.700 --> 21:48.360
kanashimi sae kasundeku maboroshi

21:41.700 --> 21:48.360
But that illusion which blurred even sadness had

21:49.660 --> 21:51.200
It's a nice morning.

21:49.920 --> 21:54.640
yagatekieta

21:49.920 --> 21:54.640
Disappeared before long.

21:51.410 --> 21:52.910
All right, let's go.

21:52.910 --> 21:54.330
Yes, Mana-sa-

21:54.640 --> 21:59.500
Remember on my mind, hoo...

21:59.500 --> 22:05.460
nagareru ano kumo ni kokoro kasanete

21:59.500 --> 22:05.460
If I place my heart on those drifting clouds, surely

22:07.460 --> 22:12.850
ima wo aoku tadayoeba itoshii kimi e to

22:07.460 --> 22:12.850
They’ll carry it across the blue skies to you, my beloved.

22:13.560 --> 22:21.200
omoi dake ga Ah... tsutawareba ii noni

22:13.560 --> 22:21.200
If only I could Ah… communicate these feelings to you…

22:21.200 --> 22:29.460
dare mo shiranai mirai itsuka ai takute

22:21.200 --> 22:29.460
In a future known to no one, I want to see you someday –

22:24.980 --> 22:26.690
Aono-san!

22:29.460 --> 22:39.140
sono toki wo matteru miageru ano sora de

22:29.460 --> 22:39.140
And for that time I wait, while looking up at the sky.

22:33.990 --> 22:35.660
Hurry, hurry!

22:37.410 --> 22:41.080
She seems to be really attached to you.

22:41.420 --> 22:43.380
Yes, I know.

22:48.720 --> 22:56.500
omoi dake ga Ah... tsutawareba ii n da

22:48.720 --> 22:56.500
It’s fine with me if Ah… my feelings would just get to you.

22:56.500 --> 23:04.820
nani mo iranai tada ne hitotsu no yume wo ne

22:56.500 --> 23:04.820
I don’t need anything – just that I feel that I’ve been

22:58.140 --> 22:59.060
Not yet?

22:59.640 --> 23:01.350
Just a little more...

23:06.820 --> 23:15.380
kanjiteta to omou yo miageru ano sora de

23:06.820 --> 23:15.380
Experiencing just that one dream, while looking up at the sky.

23:07.110 --> 23:08.280
How odd.

23:08.740 --> 23:10.280
I put coins in it, though...

23:10.910 --> 23:11.740
Step aside.

23:18.120 --> 23:20.000
Thank you very much!
